1
00:00:01,590 --> 00:00:03,590
[alarm blaring]

2
00:00:05,130 --> 00:00:06,800
[ANNOUNCER 03-A (F)]
Devil King Army alert!

3
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,800
Devil King Army alert!

4
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:11,260
Due to the massive
scale of this attack

5
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:13,390
the participation
of any adventurers

6
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:14,930
who may be present
in the capital

7
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,730
is now requested!

8
00:00:18,230 --> 00:00:19,480
♪

9
00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:53,530
[demon army roaring]

10
00:01:53,610 --> 00:01:55,530
Defend the capital men!

11
00:01:55,620 --> 00:01:58,490
We aren't frightened
by the Devil King's army!

12
00:01:58,910 --> 00:02:02,080
Let's see.
Your name's Kazuma Satou, yes?

13
00:02:02,460 --> 00:02:03,960
I'm sorry about this

14
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:06,380
but the level
requirement is 30.

15
00:02:06,790 --> 00:02:08,000
It's all right.

16
00:02:08,090 --> 00:02:09,550
This man should
join the fight.

17
00:02:09,630 --> 00:02:11,300
He's accomplished
more than most.

18
00:02:11,470 --> 00:02:13,090
- Thanks, Claire!
- Yeah, that's right!

19
00:02:13,180 --> 00:02:14,180
I've heard of this guy!

20
00:02:14,260 --> 00:02:15,800
He's the one
who took down the Destroyer!

21
00:02:15,890 --> 00:02:17,430
That's not all he's known for.

22
00:02:17,510 --> 00:02:19,310
In Arcanretia,
he got rid of Hans

23
00:02:19,390 --> 00:02:20,640
the Deadly Poison, too.

24
00:02:20,730 --> 00:02:22,850
Damn! This is the champion
of Axel himself,

25
00:02:22,940 --> 00:02:24,190
Kazuma Satou!

26
00:02:24,270 --> 00:02:27,190
[ALL]
Kazuma!

27
00:02:27,270 --> 00:02:28,940
[all chanting]
Kazuma!

28
00:02:30,990 --> 00:02:33,110
There's no need
for all of that.

29
00:02:34,030 --> 00:02:37,120
Because this legend
is only getting started.

30
00:02:38,410 --> 00:02:40,160
[cheering]

31
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,330
[KAZUMA]
I've got this!

32
00:02:45,420 --> 00:02:47,040
Big bro'll make you proud!

33
00:02:49,460 --> 00:02:50,840
Hey, Kazuma, listen to me!

34
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:52,590
I've learned
from past experiences!

35
00:02:52,670 --> 00:02:54,800
And I get the feeling
this thing won't end well.

36
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:56,760
It's just like
getting caught in the blast

37
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,890
when some crazy girl
uses her Explosion magic

38
00:02:58,970 --> 00:03:01,020
or being stuck
in a stampede of monsters

39
00:03:01,100 --> 00:03:02,600
that a meathead girl attracts!

40
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,680
Wait just a minute.

41
00:03:03,770 --> 00:03:05,560
Of all people,
who are you calling crazy?

42
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:07,480
How dare you refer
to me as a meathead!

43
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:09,900
All I wanna do now
is go back to Axel, okay?

44
00:03:09,980 --> 00:03:11,110
[KAZUMA]
Shh!

45
00:03:11,530 --> 00:03:12,610
These cowards think

46
00:03:12,690 --> 00:03:14,650
they can win
by outnumbering us.

47
00:03:15,650 --> 00:03:17,910
But, I'm gonna show 'em
who they're dealin' with.

48
00:03:17,990 --> 00:03:19,660
[all cheering]

49
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:24,330
Let the battle begin!

50
00:03:24,410 --> 00:03:27,460
Devil King opposition
forces advance!

51
00:03:30,630 --> 00:03:32,210
[sighs]

52
00:03:32,630 --> 00:03:35,050
[whimpering]

53
00:03:38,850 --> 00:03:40,010
Hello again, Eris.

54
00:03:40,100 --> 00:03:41,390
It's been a while.

55
00:04:00,830 --> 00:04:01,870
Ah, come on Eris!

56
00:04:01,950 --> 00:04:04,490
It's not what you're thinking!
I promise you!

57
00:04:04,580 --> 00:04:07,000
[KAZUMA] So things were going
great at first.

58
00:04:07,410 --> 00:04:09,920
[AQUA]
Kazuma, get this thing off me!

59
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:12,000
Hurry up and do something!

60
00:04:12,420 --> 00:04:13,670
Snipe!

61
00:04:14,050 --> 00:04:15,300
[gasps]
[thuds]

62
00:04:17,010 --> 00:04:18,050
What's going on here?

63
00:04:18,130 --> 00:04:19,550
Aren't you supposed
to be a Goddess?

64
00:04:19,630 --> 00:04:20,720
How are you gettin'
your ass kicked

65
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:23,310
by generic trash mobs
like kobolds?

66
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:25,520
- [Aqua crying]
- Hmm?

67
00:04:25,850 --> 00:04:29,190
[AQUA] They're about to regret
ever defiling this Goddess.

68
00:04:29,350 --> 00:04:31,860
I'll put the fear
of the divine in them!

69
00:04:31,940 --> 00:04:35,610
God Blow!

70
00:04:36,190 --> 00:04:37,440
God Requiem!

71
00:04:37,530 --> 00:04:38,950
- God Requiem!
- I guess she'll be fine.

72
00:04:39,030 --> 00:04:41,910
Nature's Beauty!
God Requiem!

73
00:04:41,990 --> 00:04:44,160
[KAZUMA]
A kobold, huh?

74
00:04:44,490 --> 00:04:46,790
Considering I've taken
on the Devil King's generals

75
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:49,170
you're in trouble, buddy!

76
00:04:49,710 --> 00:04:51,080
Quit running away!

77
00:04:51,170 --> 00:04:53,340
Get back here, ya little punk!

78
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:57,010
In the Demonic Army,
you threaten the peace.

79
00:04:57,380 --> 00:04:59,970
But, with my
Chunchunmaru I'll end...

80
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:10,350
[KAZUMA] What do I do?
This is embarrassing!

81
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:12,150
I was running' around
the battlefield

82
00:05:12,230 --> 00:05:14,440
looking' all smug
and got swarmed to death

83
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:16,150
by some kobolds!

84
00:05:16,530 --> 00:05:19,990
Eris is so annoyed
she won't even talk to me!

85
00:05:20,150 --> 00:05:22,990
Sexual harassment?
Really, Kazuma?

86
00:05:24,410 --> 00:05:27,620
The other day with one
of my followers, you...

87
00:05:29,910 --> 00:05:31,000
Of course!

88
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:32,290
You must've been
watching things

89
00:05:32,370 --> 00:05:34,750
down on the surface
and that explains why.

90
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:37,170
Look, you can't really
blame me, can ya?

91
00:05:37,260 --> 00:05:39,340
When I caught her,
she had such a flat chest

92
00:05:39,420 --> 00:05:41,550
I just figured that
she was another guy.

93
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:43,890
It's no big deal!

94
00:05:44,100 --> 00:05:46,060
[both whimpering]

95
00:05:46,890 --> 00:05:50,140
I'm so sorry!
I'll stop making excuses!

96
00:05:51,770 --> 00:05:53,270
Honestly.

97
00:05:53,350 --> 00:05:54,350
Well, I suppose

98
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:56,320
I could make this
one exception.

99
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:58,110
[KAZUMA]
Thanks so much for this!

100
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:00,030
I wasn't sure
what I was gonna do

101
00:06:00,190 --> 00:06:02,200
if I'd really upset
an adorable heroine

102
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:03,990
like Eris, the Goddess.

103
00:06:04,070 --> 00:06:06,240
You're getting carried away.

104
00:06:06,330 --> 00:06:08,410
That new little sister
of yours hasn't given

105
00:06:08,580 --> 00:06:10,500
you a big head, now has she?

106
00:06:13,290 --> 00:06:15,880
Guess you've been
watching a lot, haven't you?

107
00:06:17,380 --> 00:06:20,260
- [laughs]
- [sighs]

108
00:06:21,220 --> 00:06:22,970
[ERIS]
No more teasing for now.

109
00:06:24,260 --> 00:06:27,100
Actually, I need
your assistance with something.

110
00:06:27,180 --> 00:06:28,390
You do?

111
00:06:29,220 --> 00:06:31,770
You will not be
rewarded for this, however.

112
00:06:31,850 --> 00:06:34,730
Nor will you gain
a single moment of glory.

113
00:06:34,810 --> 00:06:35,770
Huh?

114
00:06:37,020 --> 00:06:38,940
But I trust you implicitly

115
00:06:39,030 --> 00:06:41,110
and felt that I could ask.

116
00:06:41,530 --> 00:06:43,860
That said, will you help
to collect

117
00:06:43,950 --> 00:06:45,450
the Divine Treasures?

118
00:06:49,740 --> 00:06:51,290
Hmm.

119
00:06:51,540 --> 00:06:54,250
Hey, look,
it's killed-by-kobolds Kazuma!

120
00:06:54,330 --> 00:06:56,040
Glad to see you back!
[chuckles]

121
00:06:56,130 --> 00:06:58,540
What?
I'm back from the dead

122
00:06:58,630 --> 00:07:00,250
and that's the first
thing you say?

123
00:07:00,340 --> 00:07:01,340
[KNIGHT 05-C(M)]
Let's clean up

124
00:07:01,420 --> 00:07:02,970
the Devil King army's
leftovers!

125
00:07:03,050 --> 00:07:04,630
Are you ready, men?

126
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,510
[all cheering]
Yeah!

127
00:07:08,100 --> 00:07:09,430
[KAZUMA]
What'll I do now?

128
00:07:09,510 --> 00:07:11,640
Things have gotten
a lot more complicated.

129
00:07:12,390 --> 00:07:15,190
Some of the Divine Treasures
the useless Goddess

130
00:07:15,270 --> 00:07:16,900
has been giving
reincarnated people

131
00:07:16,980 --> 00:07:18,520
have gone missing.

132
00:07:19,150 --> 00:07:20,730
[ERIS]
One of them has the ability

133
00:07:20,820 --> 00:07:22,150
to summon a monster at random

134
00:07:22,230 --> 00:07:24,530
for no additional cost
although,

135
00:07:24,610 --> 00:07:27,450
an offering is necessary
to get them to obey.

136
00:07:28,740 --> 00:07:30,200
The other possesses the rather

137
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:32,080
distinctive power
to switch bodies

138
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:34,790
with another person
for a limited period of time.

139
00:07:36,210 --> 00:07:37,580
[KAZUMA]
And if they're used by anyone

140
00:07:37,670 --> 00:07:39,380
but the people
who were reincarnated,

141
00:07:39,460 --> 00:07:41,750
they could wreak havoc
on the whole world.

142
00:07:43,710 --> 00:07:46,010
I wanna go home.

143
00:07:46,090 --> 00:07:48,220
[DARKNESS]
Kazuma, you were resurrected!

144
00:07:48,300 --> 00:07:49,510
[KAZUMA]
I'm Kazuma

145
00:07:49,590 --> 00:07:51,180
And are you feeling
back to normal?

146
00:07:51,260 --> 00:07:53,140
[Knight 05-D]
The courage you
displayed on the battlefield

147
00:07:53,220 --> 00:07:54,270
left me in chills!

148
00:07:54,350 --> 00:07:55,520
[Knight 05-E]
Seeing you battered by those

149
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:57,020
intense spells as you charged

150
00:07:57,100 --> 00:07:59,480
through the center
of the Devil King's forces.

151
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:02,070
[DARKNESS]
Bring it on!

152
00:08:02,150 --> 00:08:03,440
[Knight 05-D]
We'll never forget the sight

153
00:08:03,530 --> 00:08:04,820
of the Devil King's Commander

154
00:08:04,900 --> 00:08:06,450
when he saw you
coming straight for them.

155
00:08:06,530 --> 00:08:08,030
- Will we, men?
- [knights laughing]

156
00:08:08,410 --> 00:08:10,620
Well, y'know,
I suppose I just...

157
00:08:10,700 --> 00:08:12,990
Kazuma, do not
overexert yourself

158
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:14,540
and get some rest, okay?

159
00:08:14,620 --> 00:08:16,120
[KAZUMA]
Sure thing.

160
00:08:16,500 --> 00:08:17,580
[KNIGHT 05-F(M)]
Make way!

161
00:08:17,660 --> 00:08:20,420
The real hero of the battle
is coming through!

162
00:08:20,500 --> 00:08:21,840
Clear a path!

163
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,800
[KNIGHTS]
Hooray! Hooray!

164
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:25,300
[Knight 05-G ]
She needs to recuperate!

165
00:08:25,380 --> 00:08:27,840
Do you fools want
to get blown away?

166
00:08:28,380 --> 00:08:30,840
Known as the foremost
magic wielder in Axel

167
00:08:30,930 --> 00:08:32,800
and one who reduces
all to ash,

168
00:08:32,890 --> 00:08:35,140
Megumin's the wizard
is coming through.

169
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:37,390
[KAZUMA]
What in the actual hell?

170
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:39,270
Every time the enemy
commander felt

171
00:08:39,350 --> 00:08:41,400
he was at a disadvantage,
he always said,

172
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,770
"Today was nothing
more than a prelude!"

173
00:08:43,860 --> 00:08:45,940
Soon, I'll be invading
with double these forces,

174
00:08:46,030 --> 00:08:48,070
and we'll all reduce
the capital to cinders!"

175
00:08:48,150 --> 00:08:49,990
I was getting sick
and tired of hearing it,

176
00:08:50,070 --> 00:08:51,370
but then you...

177
00:08:51,740 --> 00:08:54,330
[MEGUMIN] Explosion!

178
00:08:55,830 --> 00:08:57,580
[blasts]

179
00:08:59,660 --> 00:09:01,330
My name is Megumin!

180
00:09:01,420 --> 00:09:03,590
The foremost wizard
in the town of Axel

181
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:08,670
It would appear that
you are the ones

182
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:11,510
who have been
reduced to... ash.

183
00:09:12,220 --> 00:09:13,680
[Knight 05-I ]
It was so sweet!

184
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:14,800
[Knight 05-J]
Indeed!

185
00:09:14,890 --> 00:09:17,100
'Cause she poured every
last bit of her magic power

186
00:09:17,180 --> 00:09:18,810
into that amazing explosion!

187
00:09:18,890 --> 00:09:21,190
It's true!
I most certainly did!

188
00:09:21,270 --> 00:09:23,190
Of course, there's really
nobody

189
00:09:23,270 --> 00:09:25,730
who can withstand
my awesome power.

190
00:09:25,820 --> 00:09:27,900
After all it was more
than enough

191
00:09:27,980 --> 00:09:29,690
to blow the Destroyer away.

192
00:09:29,780 --> 00:09:31,650
You took down the Destroyer?

193
00:09:31,740 --> 00:09:34,160
Oh, what an incredible
spell caster!

194
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:36,450
Megumin, could you
please show all of us

195
00:09:36,540 --> 00:09:38,250
your advanced magic, as well?

196
00:09:38,370 --> 00:09:40,500
[KNIGHT 05-F(M)]
Yes, I'd love to see that!

197
00:09:40,870 --> 00:09:43,540
Well, any other time
I'd give you a demonstration,

198
00:09:43,630 --> 00:09:45,790
but my powers
are used up right now.

199
00:09:46,300 --> 00:09:47,670
Too bad, isn't it?

200
00:09:47,750 --> 00:09:48,840
[KNIGHT 05-I (M)]
Oh, we don't mind waiting

201
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,170
till tomorrow, Megumin!

202
00:09:50,260 --> 00:09:51,380
[KNIGHT 05-F(M)]
This is gonna be great!

203
00:09:51,470 --> 00:09:54,300
I plan on bringing
a whole bunch of my friends!

204
00:09:54,390 --> 00:09:56,430
[MEGUMIN] I-I'm not sure
if tomorrow would be...

205
00:09:56,510 --> 00:09:57,640
I, uh...

206
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:59,100
Oh! Hey, Kazuma!

207
00:09:59,180 --> 00:10:01,060
I see you're alive
and kicking again!

208
00:10:01,140 --> 00:10:02,770
Resurrection must be
exhausting!

209
00:10:02,850 --> 00:10:04,400
But, don't worry about a thing.

210
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:06,150
I'll look after you tomorrow.

211
00:10:06,610 --> 00:10:07,820
K-Kazuma? Kazuma!

212
00:10:07,900 --> 00:10:10,150
K-Kazuma? Kazuma!

213
00:10:15,780 --> 00:10:17,700
[KAZUMA]
Okay, call me curious

214
00:10:17,780 --> 00:10:20,080
but what happened to you
looking after me?

215
00:10:20,160 --> 00:10:22,370
[MEGUMIN]
Kazuma, let's head back to Axel

216
00:10:22,460 --> 00:10:23,960
first thing tomorrow morning.

217
00:10:24,330 --> 00:10:25,460
[sighs]

218
00:10:26,290 --> 00:10:27,460
- [panting]
- Huh?!

219
00:10:27,790 --> 00:10:29,880
So glad you're all right,
Elder Brother!

220
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,090
Elder what?

221
00:10:31,170 --> 00:10:32,300
Oh, hey, Princess.

222
00:10:32,510 --> 00:10:34,510
Well, I'm not sure
I'd use the word "all right"

223
00:10:34,590 --> 00:10:36,390
considering I died
and came back.

224
00:10:36,470 --> 00:10:37,470
What?

225
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:38,890
That sounds awful.

226
00:10:38,970 --> 00:10:41,310
Please, come and rest
till the victory banquet.

227
00:10:41,390 --> 00:10:44,190
Your bedroom is exactly
as you left it, Elder Brother.

228
00:10:44,270 --> 00:10:45,770
There it is again!

229
00:10:45,850 --> 00:10:47,110
♪

230
00:10:50,820 --> 00:10:53,070
[MEGUMIN]
This room is pretty amazing.

231
00:10:53,780 --> 00:10:54,780
I can understand

232
00:10:54,860 --> 00:10:56,620
why you didn't want
to go home.

233
00:10:56,870 --> 00:10:57,990
I know, right?

234
00:10:58,070 --> 00:11:00,450
The food they prepare
is fan-friggin'-tastic.

235
00:11:00,540 --> 00:11:02,120
So, yeah,
bet you'd never want to leave

236
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:04,040
this castle either, Megumin.

237
00:11:04,620 --> 00:11:07,960
But, since I didn't get
a whole lot done out here,

238
00:11:08,210 --> 00:11:10,670
guess we'll head back, tomorrow.

239
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:13,760
[MEGUMIN] Though I did enjoy
using my explosion magic

240
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:15,550
- in the capital.
- Huh!

241
00:11:17,140 --> 00:11:18,090
[sighs]

242
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:22,430
Honestly, I prefer
the four of us together,

243
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:23,980
whether we're all bickering

244
00:11:24,060 --> 00:11:28,100
or taking on quests in Axel,
nothing can replace that.

245
00:11:28,190 --> 00:11:29,190
♪

246
00:11:30,230 --> 00:11:32,400
Yeah, you've got
a point Megumin!

247
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:33,490
But I wouldn't mind

248
00:11:33,570 --> 00:11:35,450
if things calmed down
a little bit.

249
00:11:35,990 --> 00:11:37,320
[giggles]

250
00:11:37,450 --> 00:11:40,410
Hmm. -[door opening
and closing] -Elder Brother,

251
00:11:41,030 --> 00:11:42,330
I am really sorry.

252
00:11:42,700 --> 00:11:43,750
I, uh...

253
00:11:43,830 --> 00:11:45,080
I asked Claire if it would be

254
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:47,540
all right for you to stay
in the castle, but she...

255
00:11:47,630 --> 00:11:49,340
[KAZUMA]
It is what it is.

256
00:11:49,630 --> 00:11:51,710
♪

257
00:11:52,380 --> 00:11:54,470
Really sorry
I couldn't be of more help.

258
00:11:54,550 --> 00:11:57,180
There is no need
for you to apologize!

259
00:11:57,800 --> 00:12:00,260
After all you literally
risked your life

260
00:12:00,350 --> 00:12:02,060
to help us in the battle.

261
00:12:03,890 --> 00:12:05,020
[KAZUMA]
I'm sorry.

262
00:12:05,100 --> 00:12:06,600
But you've got a big brother

263
00:12:06,690 --> 00:12:08,980
who was clobbered by kobolds.

264
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:10,690
Excuse me.

265
00:12:10,770 --> 00:12:12,520
Can you stop acting
like I'm not here?

266
00:12:12,610 --> 00:12:13,650
[IRIS]
That wasn't my intention...

267
00:12:13,730 --> 00:12:15,190
What in the world
is your problem!?

268
00:12:15,280 --> 00:12:17,360
[KAZUMA]
How could we forget about you?

269
00:12:17,780 --> 00:12:19,450
- Hang on.
- [BOTH] Huh!

270
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:23,330
I didn't notice
you wearing it earlier

271
00:12:23,410 --> 00:12:25,620
but that's quite
the magic item you've got.

272
00:12:26,290 --> 00:12:27,620
I'm sensing an incredible

273
00:12:27,710 --> 00:12:29,960
amount of power coming
from your necklace. -Huh!

274
00:12:30,380 --> 00:12:32,670
Originally, it was given
to my older brother,

275
00:12:32,750 --> 00:12:34,380
Jatice, some time ago.

276
00:12:34,460 --> 00:12:35,920
But since he's on deployment,

277
00:12:36,010 --> 00:12:37,010
I thought it would be best

278
00:12:37,090 --> 00:12:38,300
to look after it for him.

279
00:12:38,430 --> 00:12:40,720
Huh?! So, what kind of power
does it hold?

280
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:42,720
Could it be something
that might potentially

281
00:12:42,800 --> 00:12:44,100
destroy the whole world?

282
00:12:44,180 --> 00:12:45,720
No, I don't think so.

283
00:12:45,970 --> 00:12:48,940
Although, nobody is certain
of exactly how to use it.

284
00:12:49,020 --> 00:12:51,560
Your imagination's
getting the best of you.

285
00:12:51,650 --> 00:12:53,320
There's some kind
of inscription

286
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:55,110
on the back of it, as well.

287
00:12:55,530 --> 00:12:56,650
But the castle's scholars

288
00:12:56,740 --> 00:12:58,450
haven't been able
to decipher it.

289
00:12:58,820 --> 00:13:00,490
Wait, is that Japanese.

290
00:13:00,570 --> 00:13:01,620
Huh, that's weird.

291
00:13:01,700 --> 00:13:02,950
Now, let's see here.

292
00:13:03,030 --> 00:13:04,540
It says,
"What's yours is mine."

293
00:13:04,620 --> 00:13:06,750
Under that, it says,
"What's mine is yours.

294
00:13:06,830 --> 00:13:08,660
And so, now I am you."

295
00:13:08,750 --> 00:13:10,460
Is that some kinda joke?

296
00:13:10,540 --> 00:13:12,000
You can read it, Elder Brother?

297
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:14,550
Yeah, it's a language
called Japanese...

298
00:13:14,630 --> 00:13:16,840
Wait a minute, you guys!
The necklace started glowing!

299
00:13:17,670 --> 00:13:19,430
Okay, time to throw
it away, Iris!

300
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:22,640
Toss that thing out
the window!

301
00:13:26,010 --> 00:13:27,140
[MEGUMIN]
That's strange.

302
00:13:27,220 --> 00:13:30,940
Nothing seems to have
happened at all. [sighs]

303
00:13:31,020 --> 00:13:32,940
And I was hoping
for some massive event

304
00:13:33,020 --> 00:13:34,480
that would have
threatened the world.

305
00:13:34,570 --> 00:13:36,780
Another of life's
disappointments.

306
00:13:37,780 --> 00:13:39,280
How long are you
planning on staring

307
00:13:39,450 --> 00:13:40,860
at each other?
Now, come on,

308
00:13:40,950 --> 00:13:43,450
you have got to stop
acting like I'm not right here!

309
00:13:43,530 --> 00:13:46,120
[IRIS] No, Megumin I think
somethin' pretty messed up

310
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:48,540
- just happened.
- What'd you call me?

311
00:13:48,700 --> 00:13:51,420
For your information
I'm older than you are

312
00:13:51,500 --> 00:13:53,210
so it should be
"Big Sister Megumin."

313
00:13:53,290 --> 00:13:54,830
- Uh. S'cuse me.
- Huh?!

314
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:03,090
I'm sorry, but it appears
that I'm actually Iris.

315
00:14:03,180 --> 00:14:04,640
[both whimpering]

316
00:14:05,510 --> 00:14:07,180
♪

317
00:14:07,260 --> 00:14:09,180
[IRIS] Well, what in the hell
are we gonna do now?

318
00:14:09,270 --> 00:14:11,180
We can't stay like this.

319
00:14:11,270 --> 00:14:12,480
I mean, going' through
each day

320
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:14,020
as a beautiful young girl
isn't somethin'

321
00:14:14,100 --> 00:14:15,520
that I'm opposed to.

322
00:14:15,610 --> 00:14:17,780
But it's kinda hard to say
"goodbye" to the body

323
00:14:17,860 --> 00:14:19,280
I've spent my whole
life in, as well.

324
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,690
How are you being so calm?

325
00:14:20,780 --> 00:14:23,110
And do you have any idea
what you just said?

326
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:24,990
Men are so much bigger
and stronger!

327
00:14:25,070 --> 00:14:26,830
I actually have muscles now!

328
00:14:26,910 --> 00:14:29,750
I feel like going on
an adventure right away!

329
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:31,830
I'm really sorry
but could you please

330
00:14:31,910 --> 00:14:34,080
not talk to us with that
look on your face?

331
00:14:34,790 --> 00:14:37,420
[IRIS] I tried using exactly
the same words as before,

332
00:14:37,500 --> 00:14:39,300
but it didn't do a damn thing.

333
00:14:39,380 --> 00:14:40,420
[MEGUMIN]
I can't believe

334
00:14:40,510 --> 00:14:42,420
it swapped your bodies
like that.

335
00:14:42,510 --> 00:14:44,130
A magic item
with this much power

336
00:14:44,220 --> 00:14:46,050
is practically unheard of.

337
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:48,600
[KAZUMA]
A magic item, huh?

338
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:52,390
If it's some kinda curse,
maybe Aqua could help.

339
00:14:52,980 --> 00:14:54,060
[ERIS]
The other possesses

340
00:14:54,140 --> 00:14:55,310
the power to switch bodies

341
00:14:55,390 --> 00:14:58,310
with another person
for a limited period of time.

342
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:03,860
That's the Treasure!

343
00:15:03,950 --> 00:15:04,820
[both gasp]

344
00:15:04,900 --> 00:15:06,360
It's gonna be okay!

345
00:15:06,450 --> 00:15:09,080
'Cause I know
what this magic tool is now!

346
00:15:09,160 --> 00:15:10,540
There's a time limit
on its effect,

347
00:15:10,620 --> 00:15:12,620
so everything's gonna
go back to normal.

348
00:15:12,700 --> 00:15:14,790
A-Are you sure about that?

349
00:15:14,870 --> 00:15:16,040
You can trust me on this one.

350
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:17,210
I got the info from the most

351
00:15:17,290 --> 00:15:18,790
reliable source ever!

352
00:15:19,130 --> 00:15:21,960
Excuse me, Elder Brother,
I uh...

353
00:15:22,300 --> 00:15:23,420
[IRIS]
What's up?

354
00:15:23,510 --> 00:15:25,420
♪

355
00:15:27,140 --> 00:15:28,720
Ah-ha.

356
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:31,390
I guess you
are at that age after all?

357
00:15:31,470 --> 00:15:33,100
But I still don't
want you playing around

358
00:15:33,180 --> 00:15:34,350
with my body, Iris.

359
00:15:34,430 --> 00:15:36,230
No, that's not what I meant!

360
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:37,810
[whimpering]

361
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:39,690
I, uh...

362
00:15:39,770 --> 00:15:41,230
I was just thinking,

363
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:43,280
it'd be nice to leave
here without any guards,

364
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,820
for once. Please?

365
00:15:44,900 --> 00:15:46,030
To go outside?

366
00:15:46,110 --> 00:15:47,110
That's right.

367
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:49,990
Well, I guess looking
the way you do right now.

368
00:15:50,070 --> 00:15:52,620
But, sending you
out there all alone.

369
00:15:53,410 --> 00:15:56,710
- I shouldn't, then?
- Oh!

370
00:15:57,500 --> 00:15:59,920
[sighs]
I don't mind going with her.

371
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:01,340
Megumin?

372
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:03,510
It's not as if Princess Kazuma

373
00:16:03,590 --> 00:16:05,170
would be able to go
out there with her.

374
00:16:05,340 --> 00:16:07,590
And with me things
won't be half as strict

375
00:16:07,680 --> 00:16:08,970
as they are with those guards.

376
00:16:09,050 --> 00:16:10,340
Big Sister Megumin!

377
00:16:10,430 --> 00:16:11,970
Do you really mean it?

378
00:16:12,890 --> 00:16:14,770
I realize I made
the request myself,

379
00:16:14,850 --> 00:16:16,270
but maybe sticking
with "Megumin"

380
00:16:16,350 --> 00:16:17,770
is a good idea, after all.

381
00:16:17,850 --> 00:16:18,940
Oh, Megumin!

382
00:16:19,020 --> 00:16:20,610
Thanks so much for this!

383
00:16:20,690 --> 00:16:22,060
You're in good hands!

384
00:16:22,150 --> 00:16:23,570
Because I can teach you
everything

385
00:16:23,650 --> 00:16:25,190
from how to bargain
for the best prices

386
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:27,780
to handling yourself
when somebody picks a fight!

387
00:16:27,860 --> 00:16:30,740
[KAZUMA]
Okay, maybe this plan sucks.

388
00:16:30,820 --> 00:16:31,950
- Yay!
- Yay!

389
00:16:32,030 --> 00:16:33,700
KONOSUBA!

390
00:16:33,790 --> 00:16:35,790
♪

391
00:16:40,920 --> 00:16:44,630
Greetings, Hi, hey.

392
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:46,970
[KAZUMA]
Hell, yeah.

393
00:16:47,050 --> 00:16:49,430
I could really get used
to this stuff.

394
00:16:50,680 --> 00:16:51,800
Princess Iris.

395
00:16:51,890 --> 00:16:53,350
Has that man taught you
something

396
00:16:53,430 --> 00:16:55,470
reprehensibly seedy, again?

397
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:59,560
Claire, I'll have you know
he's wonderful.

398
00:16:59,650 --> 00:17:00,730
The type of person

399
00:17:00,810 --> 00:17:02,480
who'll go down
in history books.

400
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:05,440
[CLAIRE] Seriously, what kind
of things has he told you?

401
00:17:05,940 --> 00:17:06,940
Madness.

402
00:17:07,030 --> 00:17:09,610
Perhaps I ought to deal
with him once and for all.

403
00:17:09,990 --> 00:17:11,870
[KAZUMA]
I'm standing right here.

404
00:17:11,950 --> 00:17:14,370
Really wish she wouldn't
threaten me like that.

405
00:17:14,660 --> 00:17:16,290
Princess Iris!

406
00:17:16,950 --> 00:17:18,410
[CLAIRE]
Sir Mitsurugi.

407
00:17:19,580 --> 00:17:21,250
I hear you were just
as incredible

408
00:17:21,330 --> 00:17:22,790
in this battle as the others.

409
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:24,250
Oh, no.

410
00:17:24,540 --> 00:17:26,590
I'm just doing my duty.

411
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:31,930
[KAZUMA] I've never seen her
make that face!

412
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:35,350
I feel it's my duty
to protect the people

413
00:17:35,430 --> 00:17:38,850
of the kingdom as well
as Princess Iris, of course.

414
00:17:39,980 --> 00:17:40,980
Oh, Claire.

415
00:17:41,060 --> 00:17:42,650
This knave brazenly
touched my hair.

416
00:17:42,730 --> 00:17:44,150
I want him executed.

417
00:17:44,230 --> 00:17:45,360
[both gasp]

418
00:17:45,770 --> 00:17:47,320
[CLAIRE] You've been
acting so strangely!

419
00:17:47,650 --> 00:17:49,110
What's gotten into you?

420
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:51,030
I'm fully prepared to overlook

421
00:17:51,110 --> 00:17:53,280
your disrespectful gesture
for Claire's sake.

422
00:17:53,360 --> 00:17:54,910
Now take your leave.

423
00:17:54,990 --> 00:17:56,740
Go on, git!
I won't tell ya twice!

424
00:17:56,830 --> 00:17:58,290
Shoo! Shoo!

425
00:17:58,370 --> 00:18:02,000
[MITSURUGI]
As you wish. Excuse me!

426
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:03,250
[KAZUMA]
How annoying.

427
00:18:03,330 --> 00:18:05,080
I haven't been marching
around this palace

428
00:18:05,250 --> 00:18:07,170
to run into someone like you!

429
00:18:07,420 --> 00:18:08,760
I'm curious, Claire.

430
00:18:08,840 --> 00:18:10,050
Yes, Princess?

431
00:18:10,590 --> 00:18:12,430
Lalatina. Where is she?

432
00:18:12,510 --> 00:18:13,640
I want to touch...

433
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:15,430
[clears throat]

434
00:18:15,510 --> 00:18:17,350
I want to personally
congratulate her

435
00:18:17,430 --> 00:18:20,060
for being so courageous
in our most recent battle.

436
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:21,600
[CLAIRE] Lady Dustiness
said she was feeling

437
00:18:21,690 --> 00:18:23,480
a bit dirty after all
that fighting,

438
00:18:23,560 --> 00:18:26,360
so she's relaxing
in a hot bath, at the moment.

439
00:18:27,190 --> 00:18:28,820
Take me to her, right now!

440
00:18:28,900 --> 00:18:30,150
I need to join her
this instant

441
00:18:30,230 --> 00:18:31,740
and wash her back,
you understand?

442
00:18:31,820 --> 00:18:34,990
I'm not sure a royal
should wash a subject's back.

443
00:18:35,610 --> 00:18:37,200
Well, I'd also like
to wash yours

444
00:18:37,280 --> 00:18:39,950
as a way of showing
my appreciation for all you do.

445
00:18:40,790 --> 00:18:43,750
Unless, you'd rather not?

446
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:46,330
I wouldn't dare refuse!

447
00:18:46,670 --> 00:18:47,960
Come, Princess Iris!

448
00:18:48,130 --> 00:18:50,420
We should be on our way,
then! Immediately!

449
00:18:50,500 --> 00:18:52,880
This is an honor
beyond my wildest dreams!

450
00:18:52,970 --> 00:18:55,760
Let's go! Let's go, go, go!

451
00:18:55,840 --> 00:18:56,970
[KAZUMA]
Uh, what?

452
00:18:57,050 --> 00:18:59,720
There's somethin' about
the way she's looking at Iris.

453
00:19:00,770 --> 00:19:02,310
She's one of those!

454
00:19:02,390 --> 00:19:04,600
I knew she never
let Iris out of her sight,

455
00:19:04,690 --> 00:19:06,270
but now it all makes sense!

456
00:19:06,350 --> 00:19:09,360
Man, I'm running out
of heroine options here!

457
00:19:09,980 --> 00:19:12,360
Then again,
that could work, too.

458
00:19:12,440 --> 00:19:15,650
Konosuba!

459
00:19:16,990 --> 00:19:18,410
Oh, Princess Iris.

460
00:19:18,490 --> 00:19:20,080
Are you here to clean up
a little bit

461
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:21,410
before the party, as well?

462
00:19:21,490 --> 00:19:22,750
[CLAIRE]
Yes!

463
00:19:23,580 --> 00:19:25,160
[DARKNESS]
Princess Iris?

464
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:30,290
Actually, I wanted
to wash your back

465
00:19:30,380 --> 00:19:32,840
out of respect for all
you've done in battle.

466
00:19:35,050 --> 00:19:37,890
Although,
it seems I'm too late.

467
00:19:39,140 --> 00:19:40,760
A shame, isn't it?

468
00:19:41,560 --> 00:19:43,100
I, I would not dream
of wasting

469
00:19:43,180 --> 00:19:44,310
your good intentions!

470
00:19:44,390 --> 00:19:45,940
I can easily go right back in!

471
00:19:46,020 --> 00:19:49,110
So-So, you're taking off
your clothes in front of me?

472
00:19:49,190 --> 00:19:50,610
[KAZUMA]
She caught me off guard!

473
00:19:50,690 --> 00:19:51,900
I'm not mentally prepared

474
00:19:51,980 --> 00:19:53,360
Come on, get a grip!

475
00:19:53,440 --> 00:19:55,150
Control yourself,
Kazuma Satou!

476
00:19:55,240 --> 00:19:57,820
You've been in the bath
with Darkness before!

477
00:19:57,910 --> 00:19:59,870
Uh, is something the matter?

478
00:20:01,120 --> 00:20:02,830
You appear a little bit
flushed to me.

479
00:20:03,370 --> 00:20:05,870
[KAZUMA] [sniffs]
Smells good.

480
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:08,750
Wait, no! This is bad!

481
00:20:08,920 --> 00:20:10,710
If Iris catches a whiff
of the soap,

482
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:13,170
she's definitely gonna know
I was in the bath!

483
00:20:13,250 --> 00:20:14,630
I can't believe this!

484
00:20:14,710 --> 00:20:16,840
Just when I've got the view
of a lifetime

485
00:20:16,930 --> 00:20:17,930
in front of me!

486
00:20:18,010 --> 00:20:19,050
Gotta be strong!

487
00:20:19,140 --> 00:20:20,300
I've gotta hang in there!

488
00:20:20,390 --> 00:20:21,810
If she finds out,
I'm gonna be...

489
00:20:21,890 --> 00:20:23,720
You feeling all right,
Princess?

490
00:20:24,350 --> 00:20:27,020
You've been acting
rather strangely.

491
00:20:28,100 --> 00:20:30,270
♪

492
00:20:31,020 --> 00:20:33,480
[KAZUMA]
Yeah, I understand now.

493
00:20:34,030 --> 00:20:36,030
I know why that
other reincarnation

494
00:20:36,110 --> 00:20:38,110
wanted this Divine Treasure.

495
00:20:38,740 --> 00:20:41,700
And I don't give
a damn anymore!

496
00:20:41,780 --> 00:20:44,040
Let Iris smell the soap
and figure out

497
00:20:44,120 --> 00:20:46,700
that I've been in the bath,
for all I care!

498
00:20:47,830 --> 00:20:49,580
♪

499
00:20:50,790 --> 00:20:53,340
One of my great
Japanese ancestors

500
00:20:53,420 --> 00:20:56,170
once dropped an insightful
pearl of wisdom.

501
00:20:58,050 --> 00:21:00,760
"In certain situations,
one must worry

502
00:21:00,840 --> 00:21:03,260
about tomorrow, tomorrow.

503
00:21:04,260 --> 00:21:06,720
Eris, the Goddess of luck.

504
00:21:08,140 --> 00:21:10,270
I want to express
nothing but gratitude

505
00:21:10,350 --> 00:21:12,150
and thankfulness
for the strength

506
00:21:12,230 --> 00:21:14,480
of my good fortune.

507
00:21:15,730 --> 00:21:17,360
♪

508
00:21:20,570 --> 00:21:22,490
Do you want some
of this, punk?

509
00:21:22,570 --> 00:21:24,780
'Cause you better be
ready for some!

510
00:21:25,330 --> 00:21:27,910
Look, you got my bro
all broken up!

511
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:30,040
Hey, Come on!
I'm not broken up!

512
00:21:30,120 --> 00:21:33,290
I've just never heard
anything so cruel before!

513
00:21:33,380 --> 00:21:34,750
[MEGUMIN]
Yeah, that's the spirit!

514
00:21:34,840 --> 00:21:36,090
You've got the hang of this!

515
00:21:36,170 --> 00:21:38,420
Now, it's time to give
him a finishing line!

516
00:21:38,510 --> 00:21:40,420
Like, "The fact that
you're strutting around

517
00:21:40,510 --> 00:21:43,010
with these underlings
only proves you're a scrub!"

518
00:21:43,090 --> 00:21:45,180
You wouldn't be
worth the experience points.

519
00:21:45,260 --> 00:21:46,470
You're trash!"

520
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:48,270
[screaming and crying]

521
00:21:48,350 --> 00:21:51,690
Stop making fun of me!

522
00:21:52,770 --> 00:21:54,480
[smacking]

523
00:23:30,700 --> 00:23:32,450
[HANS] Step right up!
Step right up!

524
00:23:32,540 --> 00:23:35,170
There are three boxes
of Slime Detergent left!

525
00:23:35,250 --> 00:23:37,040
Hey, it's me, Hans.

526
00:23:37,130 --> 00:23:38,750
Do you have a moment
to humor me?

527
00:23:38,830 --> 00:23:40,090
Sometimes, I think maybe...

